Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_copd Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for chronic obstructive pulmonary disease.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_depression Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for depression.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_diabetes Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for diabetes.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_hyperlipidemia Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for hyperlipidemia.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_hypertension Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for hypertension.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_ihd Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for ischemic heart disease.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_osteoporosis Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for osteoporosis.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_ra_oa Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for rheumatoid arthritis/osteoarthritis.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_schizophrenia Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_stroke Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for stroke.
