Table full name: bigquery-public-data.cms_medicare.nursing_facilities_2013
Column name: provider_id Type: STRING Description: The 6-digit identification number for the skilled nursing facility on the claim.
Column name: facility_name Type: STRING Description: The skilled nursing facility name, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: street_address Type: STRING Description: The skilled nursing facility address, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: city Type: STRING Description: The city where the skilled nursing facility is located, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: state Type: STRING Description: The state where the skilled nursing facility is located, as reported in POS file. The fifty U.S. states and the District of Columbia are reported by the state postal abbreviation.
Column name: zip_code Type: INT64 Description: The skilled nursing facility’s zip code, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: total_stays Type: INT64 Description: Total number of skilled nursing facility stays.
Column name: distinct_beneficiaries_per_provider Type: INT64 Description: Number of distinct Medicare beneficiaries with at least one skilled nursing facility day per provider. A beneficiary will only be counted once per provider, but may be double-counted across providers.
Column name: average_length_of_stay_days Type: INT64 Description: Average lenth of stay, in days, for all Medicare beneficiaries with at least one stay in the skilled nursing facility in the year.
Column name: total_snf_charge_amount Type: INT64 Description: Total of the charges that the skilled nursing facility submitted for all Medicare stays in the year.
Column name: total_snf_medicare_allowed_amount Type: INT64 Description: Total Medicare allowed amount for all Medicare stays in the year. This figure is the sum of the amount Medicare pays, the deductible and coinsurance amounts that the beneficiary is responsible for paying, and any amounts that a third party is responsible for paying.
Column name: total_snf_medicare_payment_amount Type: INT64 Description: Total amount that Medicare paid for all Medicare stays in the year after deductible and coinsurance amounts have been deducted.
Column name: total_snf_medicare_standard_payment_amount Type: INT64 Description: Total amount that Medicare paid for all Medicare stays in the year after deductible and coinsurance amounts have been deducted, adjusted for geographic differences in payment rates.
